WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.897
Verification combines several independent methods.

00:00:02.897 --> 00:00:10.252
Reverse image search can locate earlier appearances, alternate crops, and related versions of an image.

00:00:10.252 --> 00:00:17.606
An earlier publication may reveal that genuine media has been assigned a new false caption.

00:00:17.606 --> 00:00:24.515
For video, keyframe analysis reviews selected frames that represent scene changes or important moments.

00:00:24.515 --> 00:00:34.989
Keyframes can be compared with image-search results, landmarks, signs, weather, clothing, or previous uploads without assuming every matching frame proves the claim.

00:00:34.989 --> 00:00:40.561
Metadata may include creation time, device, software, location, or editing history.

00:00:40.561 --> 00:00:47.024
It can be stripped, changed, or fabricated, so treat it as one source.

00:00:47.024 --> 00:00:52.149
Compare metadata with visible content, publication history, and authoritative records.

00:00:52.149 --> 00:01:00.395
Timeline checking asks whether the claimed event, upload sequence, daylight, weather, public schedule, and independent reporting align.

00:01:00.395 --> 00:01:08.641
Geolocation and chronolocation clues can support place or time, but ambiguous landmarks and reused footage require caution.

00:01:08.641 --> 00:01:19.561
Cross-source corroboration looks for independent evidence with different origins: official statements, credible reporting, other recordings, direct witnesses, public records, or known event timelines.

00:01:19.561 --> 00:01:24.241
Many accounts repeating one post are not independent confirmation.

00:01:24.241 --> 00:01:25.801
Preserve uncertainty.

00:01:25.801 --> 00:01:32.710
If the evidence supports only that media is unverified or miscontextualized, report that conclusion.

00:01:32.710 --> 00:01:39.173
Do not convert an incomplete check into a claim that content is synthetic.

00:01:39.173 --> 00:01:43.407
Record what further evidence would materially change confidence.
